      "delivery": "Implemented the credit policy correction.\n\n- `availableCredit` now normalizes negative balance, reservation, and limit values to zero, clamps negative remainders to zero, and preserves its three-number-argument numeric signature.\n- `approveDebit` now normalizes negative requests to zero, caps approval at available credit, and does not mutate inputs.\n- `quoteDebit` now uses the shared credit policy for approval and remaining credit, and reports denied normalized request amount.\n- Added `apps/policy/src/debit.test.ts` covering normalization, clamping, allocation, remaining credit, and denied amounts.\n\nChecks run:\n- `npm run test:study:regression` — passed: 4/4 tests in 4 files. This configured regression suite covers original tests only.\n- `npm run test:study:types` — passed. The configured compiler excludes test files.\n- `npm run test:study:delivered` — passed: 1/1 delivered regression test.\n- `npm run typecheck:delivered` — passed: delivered source plus test typecheck.\n- `git diff --check` — passed.\n\nNo dependencies, manifests, locks, configuration, or original tests were changed.",
